<title>ESTONIA: RAKVERE 7 MONTH PROFIT 1.9 MLN KROONS.</title>
<headline>RAKVERE 7 MONTH PROFIT 1.9 MLN KROONS.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>First seven months of 1997</p>
<p>					(million kroons unless stated)</p>
<p> Net profit				   1.94 vs  1.87</p>
<p> Turnover				    356.1 vs 294.4</p>
<p>NOTE -- Rakvere meat plant financial data for the first</p>
<p>seven months is compared to the first six months of 1997.</p>
<p>Rakvere is listed on the free market of the Tallinn stock</p>
<p>exchange.</p>
